# Optional Docker Compose settings. Copy to .env for local overrides.
# All values are intentionally blank; never commit credentials to this template.
# Blank uses port 8080. Set a different local port here if needed.
PIPELINE_PORT=
# Blank derives http://localhost:<port> from PIPELINE_PORT.
# For HTTPS, set the exact public origin and keep the upstream port private.
PIPELINE_ORIGIN=
# Configure Jev/general LLM API keys, SMTP credentials and Google Sheets access
# in the app's authenticated Settings after claiming the owner account.
# Compose does not load provider credentials from this file.
